    "ctf_sr_confluence": float(features.get("ctf_sr_confluence", 0.0)),
    "ctf_sr_strongest_level": str(features.get("ctf_sr_strongest_level", "unknown")),
    "ctf_regime_divergence": float(features.get("ctf_regime_divergence", 0.0)),
    "ctf_regime_label": str(features.get("ctf_regime_label", "unknown")),
    "ctf_squeeze_divergence": float(features.get("ctf_squeeze_divergence", 0.0)),
    "ctf_squeeze_regime": str(features.get("ctf_squeeze_regime", "unknown")),
    "ctf_orderflow_alignment": float(features.get("ctf_orderflow_alignment", 0.0)),
    "ctf_orderflow_regime": str(features.get("ctf_orderflow_regime", "unknown")),
}
```

Total: 25 keys in _shadow dict (15 existing + 10 new)
</description>
<acceptance_criteria>
- [ ] All 10 new I6 fields captured in _shadow dict
- [ ] Float fields use float() cast with 0.0 default
- [ ] Str fields use str() cast with "unknown" default
- [ ] Unit tests verify _shadow dict has all 25 keys
</acceptance_criteria>
</task>

