<title>Backtest all 5 plugins on historical data</title>
<dependencies>extend capture_signal_features() for _shadow capture</dependencies>
<work_estimate>2 hours</work_estimate>
<description>
Run backtest validation for all 5 plugins using Plan 00 infrastructure:

```bash
# Backtest each plugin on 6 months data
python tools/backtest_i6_plugin.py \
  --plugin CrossTFMomentumDivergencePlugin \
  --start 2025-10-01 --end 2026-04-01 \
  --output /tmp/ctf_momentum_div.csv

python tools/backtest_i6_plugin.py \
  --plugin CrossTFSRConfluencePlugin \
  --start 2025-10-01 --end 2026-04-01 \
  --output /tmp/ctf_sr_confluence.csv

python tools/backtest_i6_plugin.py \
  --plugin CrossTFRegimeAgreementPlugin \
  --start 2025-10-01 --end 2026-04-01 \
  --output /tmp/ctf_regime_agree.csv

python tools/backtest_i6_plugin.py \
  --plugin SqueezeExpansionDivergencePlugin \
  --start 2025-10-01 --end 2026-04-01 \
  --output /tmp/ctf_squeeze_div.csv

python tools/backtest_i6_plugin.py \
  --plugin CrossTFOrderFlowAlignmentPlugin \
  --start 2025-10-01 --end 2026-04-01 \
  --output /tmp/ctf_orderflow.csv
```

Then validate each:
```bash
python tools/validate_i6_backtest.py \
  --input /tmp/ctf_momentum_div.csv \
  --field ctf_momentum_divergence \
  --min-ic 0.05 --alpha 0.01

# Repeat for all 5 plugins
```

Collect results, apply feature selection:
- **Keep (IC > 0.05):** Deploy to shadow mode
- **Tweak (IC 0.02-0.05):** Adjust parameters, retest
- **Kill (IC < 0.02):** Document as failed experiment
</description>
